00:05:17,142 --> 00:05:23,142
Fantasia 2000 is a animation, family, music film directed by James Algar.

2
00:10:34,285 --> 00:10:40,285
Blending lively music and brilliant animation, this sequel to the original
'Fantasia' restores 'The Sorcerer's Apprentice' and adds seven new shorts.

